docs/nif/01-file-format.md,"v10 header: ... NumGroups u32 + Groups u32[NumGroups] + blocks each preceded by preamble u32 == 0 (record separator, MUST be 0; 0x0A000000 <= v < 0x0A020000)",PRIOR_CLAIM_PARTIALLY_SUPERSEDED,"Engine source (Gamebryo 1.2): the ""preamble"" = per-block GroupID (NiObject::LoadBinary, 5.0.0.6 <= v < 10.1.0.114); PE NumGroups=0 hence always 0; the wiki version-range is a subset of the engine range",CLARIFY (semantic enrichment: preamble == GroupID; engine range)
