docs/nif/04-properties.md,"NiVertexColorProperty: + unknown_pe_field u32 (PE-SPECIFIC)",PARTIALLY_SUPERSEDED,"The ""PE extension"" is NOT established as a PE deviation: the same 10 bytes parse as the STANDARD schema layout (flags u16 + VertMode u32 + LightMode u32); both splits byte-compatible; baseline-consistent reading = no extra field",SUPERSEDE (drop ""PE-SPECIFIC"" claim; document the width-identical ambiguity)
docs/nif/04-properties.md,"NiTexturingProperty v10 per-slot tail_A i16 + tail_B i16 + transform_present u8 [+32B raw] + trailing u32 (always 0)",PRIOR_CLAIM_SEMANTICS_RESOLVED,"Baseline: PS2 L i16 + PS2 K i16 + Has Texture Transform u8 + [Translation/Tiling TexCoord + W Rotation f32 + Transform Type u32 + Center Offset TexCoord = 32B] + Num Shader Textures u32 (=0); the wiki's ""32-byte raw"" and ""trailing u32==0"" get exact baseline field labels",CLARIFY (semantic enrichment; structure unchanged)
docs/nif/08-ark-proprietary.md,"""These block types do NOT exist in any public NIF documentation (not in niflib, nif.xml, jnif, OpenMW)""",PARTIALLY_FALSE,"HISTORICAL nif.xml 0.7.1.1 CONTAINS 5 NiArk stubs (NiArkAnimation/Importer/Texture/ViewportInfo/Shader ExtraData) + the ArkTexture compound — the claim is false for that schema snapshot; MODERN 0.10.0.0 removed them",SUPERSEDE (correct: absent from MODERN schema + engine; PRESENT as unknown-node stubs in historical 0.7.1.1)
