docs/nif/08-ark-proprietary.md,"NiArkTextureExtraData v10: 3 unknown zero bytes + Name ...",CLARIFIED,"The ""3 unknown zero bytes"" = the importer tail's pad bytes (mis-attribution); ArkTexture starts with its NiExtraData Name directly",CLARIFY (drop the 3-byte pre-read; adjust the importer tail to 41B)
